<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BURLINGTON INDUSTRIES BEGUN.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BURLINGTON INDUSTRIES BEGUN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said Wednesday it started coverage of Burlington Industries Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Brett Barakett said in a research note the company, which makes diversified textile products, had an inexpensive but fair valuation.</p>
<p>-- Said his 1997 earnings estimate was $1.05 per share and his 1998 estimate was $1.30 per share.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 3/16 to 12-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
